# I/V converter: R and C in parallel across the same feedback path. Two
# bridges over one span, which is the case layout.py has to give different
# tiers, and the case that still draws its legs a long way left.
net GND
net VREF
net IIN
net OUT
part TL074:U1A
part 2k1:Riv
part 100p:Cf
IIN -> U1A@2
U1A@2 -> Riv@1
U1A@2 -> Cf@1
U1A@1 -> Riv@2
U1A@1 -> Cf@2
U1A@3 -> VREF
U1A@1 -> OUT
